 "runtime": "Measured incremental refinement only: complete native processes including parsing/checking, search and output, plus independent checker loading and validation. Every private parent stage is charged recursively. Excludes generation of public warm starts, compilation, persistent-harness interpreter imports, and the exploratory/tuning campaign. This is not a from-scratch runtime comparison. 2026-10-04 adoption update: carried cases exclude refinement compute (their routes were produced upstream) and carry no runtime.json entry.",
